# Classification Rules & Taxonomy Standard
**Author:** Pod B Engineering Lead[cite: 1]

To prevent inconsistent categories (e.g., treating "Data Analytics", "data analytics", and "Data Analysis" as separate values), all classifications were standardized via strict rules[cite: 2]:

## 1. Media Format Definitions
* **Carousel:** Multi-page PDF document upload or native LinkedIn multi-image carousel post.
* **Video:** Native video upload or external link embed featuring moving visual media.
* **Text/Image:** Standard single static graphic or text-only status update.

## 2. Content Pillar Taxonomy
* **Educational:** Framework breakdowns, technical guides, step-by-step tutorials.
* **Testimonial:** Success stories, cohort graduation highlights, student project showcases.
* **Promotional:** Direct calls to action for course enrollment, partnership applications, or seat sponsorships.
